<SharpAlertSource>FEMA IPAWS (WEA)</SharpAlertSource><alert xmlns="urn:oasis:names:tc:emergency:cap:1.2"><identifier>urn:oid:2.49.0.1.840.0.fcebec6db9d40245fc922ca24608e9f0a68cac9a.001.1.IPAWS</identifier><sender>w-nws.webmaster@noaa.gov</sender><sent>2026-09-25T22:21:00-05:00</sent><status>Actual</status><msgType>Alert</msgType><source>211803 v2.3.0</source><scope>Public</scope><code>IPAWSv1.0</code><info><language>en-US</language><category>Met</category><event>Tornado Warning</event><responseType>Shelter</responseType><urgency>Immediate</urgency><severity>Extreme</severity><certainty>Observed</certainty><eventCode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>TOR</value></eventCode><eventCode><valueName>NationalWeatherService</valueName><value>TOW</value></eventCode><effective>2026-09-25T22:21:00-05:00</effective><onset>2026-09-25T22:21:00-05:00</onset><expires>2026-09-25T22:45:00-05:00</expires><senderName>NWS Lubbock TX</senderName><headline>Tornado Warning issued September 25 at 10:21PM CDT until September 25 at 10:45PM CDT by NWS Lubbock TX</headline><description>TORLUB

The National Weather Service in Lubbock Texas has issued a

* Tornado Warning for...
Northwestern Parmer County in the Panhandle of Texas...

* Until 1045 PM CDT.

* At 1020 PM CDT, a severe thunderstorm capable of producing a
tornado was located 9 miles northeast of Clovis, moving east at 20
mph.

HAZARD...Tornado and ping pong ball size hail.

SOURCE...Radar indicated rotation.

IMPACT...Flying debris will be dangerous to those caught without
shelter. Mobile homes will be damaged or destroyed.
Damage to roofs, windows, and vehicles will occur.  Tree
damage is likely.

* This dangerous storm will be near...
Bovina around 1040 PM CDT.
</description><instruction>TAKE COVER NOW! Move to a basement or an interior room on the lowest
floor of a sturdy building. Avoid windows. If you are outdoors, in a
mobile home, or in a vehicle, move to the closest substantial shelter
and protect yourself from flying debris.

Tornadoes are extremely difficult to see and confirm at night. Do not
wait to see or hear the tornado. TAKE COVER NOW!

Torrential rainfall is occurring with this storm, and may lead to
flash flooding. Do not drive your vehicle through flooded roadways.</instruction><web>http://www.weather.gov</web><parameter><valueName>AWIPSidentifier</valueName><value>TORLUB</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>WMOidentifier</valueName><value>WFUS54 KLUB 260321</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>eventMotionDescription</valueName><value>2026-09-26T03:20:00Z...storm...252DEG...19KT...34.53,-103.07</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>maxHailSize</valueName><value>1.50</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>tornadoDetection</valueName><value>RADAR INDICATED</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>BLOCKCHANNEL</valueName><value>EAS</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>BLOCKCHANNEL</valueName><value>NWEM</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>EAS-ORG</valueName><value>WXR</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>VTEC</valueName><value>/O.NEW.KLUB.TO.W.0003.260926T0321Z-260926T0345Z/</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>eventEndingTime</valueName><value>2026-09-25T22:45:00-05:00</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>WEAHandling</valueName><value>Imminent Threat</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>CMAMtext</valueName><value>NWS: TORNADO WARNING in this area til 10:45 PM CDT. Take shelter now. Check media.</value></parameter><parameter><valueName>CMAMlongtext</valueName><value>National Weather Service: TORNADO WARNING in this area until 10:45 PM CDT. Take shelter now in a basement or an interior room on the lowest floor of a sturdy building. If you are outdoors, in a mobile home, or in a vehicle, move to the closest substantial shelter and protect yourself from flying debris. Check media.</value></parameter><area><areaDesc>Parmer, TX</areaDesc><polygon>34.64,-103.04 34.7,-102.87 34.5,-102.87 34.5,-103.04 34.64,-103.04</polygon><geocode><valueName>SAME</valueName><value>048369</value></geocode><geocode><valueName>UGC</valueName><value>TXC369</value></geocode></area></info><info><language>es-US</language><category>Met</category><event>Tor